<h2 id="the-skeleton">The Skeleton<a class="anchor" href="#the-skeleton" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>./kettle pop:init</code> writes a plain directory tree. This is a web application with a stand-alone console
application alongside it — answer yes to both prompts and this is what you get:</p>
